      "@type": "bootstrap:Task",
      "bpmnType": "bpmn:GlobalScriptTask",
      "description": "THE RECORD, and not relaxable, because a judgement nobody wrote down is indistinguishable from one never made (`adjudication`, A_RecordEntry). Append one `requirement-signoff` record to `test/attestations/requirement-signoff/<set slug>.attestations.json` — who (kind, id, actor), at, scope (the set or one member), the outcome from the requirement-set code list, the stage it moves the set to, the reason, and the permalink to the issue comment where it was decided — and set the set's `stage` to match.\n\nGW_SignoffRecorded after this reads the record back, so this step cannot be skipped by completing it: a sign-off that left no attestation loops here again.",
      "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/directory/processes",
      "name": "Record the sign-off as a requirement-signoff attestation",
      "requires": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/skill/adjudication",
      "sourcePath": "processes/global-tasks.bpmn",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/cat-harness/blob/main/processes/global-tasks.bpmn",
      "summary": "THE RECORD, and not relaxable, because a judgement nobody wrote down is indistinguishable from one never made (`adjudication`, A_RecordEntry)."
    },
