      "description": "Record the translation's standing in translations/<locale>/status.json. The `official` input says which: `false` records it as unofficial ({ official: false, generatedBy, generatedAt }), usable but shown with a warning badge; `true` records the human sign-off with the SHA-256 of the source .md, so a later change to the source marks it stale.",
