          "startNode": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/process/Process_CopyIntoFolio/node/Start_WantCopy",
          "summary": "Taking an asset from an upstream knowledge graph into your own folio so you can edit it, comment on it or raise todos against it — without touching the upstream source and without losing where it came from."
