          "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/assets/img/workflows/hand-back-to-discussion.svg",
          "description": "How a sibling agent gets a card, question, result, blocker or context in front of the person: through the discussion agent that is talking with them, never only in its own thread. The person's answer comes back the same way.\n\nINPUT AND OUTPUT: the `hand-back-to-discussion` skill's schemas, schemas/skills/hand-back-to-discussion/input.schema.json (from, to, kind, summary, ask = the ask-the-person input, context, links, channels, answerRoute, blocking) and output.schema.json (shown, state, chosen, quote, answeredIn, marked, deliveredBack).\n\nTHE PERSON'S STEP is inside `Process_AskThePerson`, called by the discussion agent, so the asking rule (chat text first, then the card) holds here unchanged. A Blue-column answer in a review sheet is an answer to that same question.",
          "enforcement": "strict",
          "flowCount": 14,
