          ],
          "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/assets/img/workflows/harness-default-rendering.svg",
          "description": "Renders a harness layer as its default interface: its left-hand nav and docs on its own theme's art, and a board of its todos and beans from which a reader reads, reviews and, when a write tool is available, proposes changes into the publication review.\n\nThe theme art goes behind every docs page.\n\nRead-only is the floor. Whether the reader may write is a question about the tools the session has (git-push, github-api, github-connector) and the reader's permissions, so the gateway reads capabilities and never assumes one write path. A change a reader proposes enters the content change review in folio-assistant-core (`content-change-review.bpmn`); this process enables that review and does not replace it.",
          "enforcement": "strict",
          "flowCount": 10,
          "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/directory/processes",
          "name": "A harness's default rendering",
