          "description": "WireGen (methodologies/wiregen) made executable: a written design intent, at least two mid-fidelity candidates each with a web AND a mobile layout, mechanical checks, a blind per-criterion review, adjudication where reviewers disagree, and a recorded choice. A wireframe is part of the design process for adjudication. Operating skill: wireframe-design-review. The same mechanical checks back the as-is wireframe every declared visualiser owes, which `check:wireframes` runs.",
